Package: pubchroma
Title: Journal-Inspired Color Palettes and Figure QA for Scientific Publications
Version: 0.3.0
Authors@R: person("tyuan2024", email = "tyuan2024@126.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: PubChroma + FigureLint-Bio: a toolkit for journal-inspired colour
    recommendation and pre-submission figure quality assurance. Provides palettes
    drawn from Nature, Science, Cell, NEJM, Lancet, JAMA, PNAS, and BMJ with
    field-aware selection, colorblind-safety checking, palette validation, and
    figure spec linting for biomedical and engineering visualizations.
